---
title: Fresh run · inventory room
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef fail stroke-width:1.6px

    [*] --> count : fresh start, lease held
    state count <<choice>>
    count --> admit : [fewer than 64]
    count --> archive : [64, a removed run]
    count --> refused : [64 keep data]
    archive --> count : oldest removed archived
    admit --> [*]
    refused --> [*]

    note right of archive
        Same proof as graph archive:
        every owned resource absent,
        no pending journal.
    end note
    note right of refused
        graph_retention_budget:
        remove the data of a
        project you no longer use.
    end note

    class admit ok
    class refused fail
